Package: tennisage
Type: Package
Title: Visualize Tennis Career Matches by Player and Opponent Age
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Jeremy Cai
Maintainer: Jeremy Cai <jeremycai@berkeley.edu>
Description: Retrieves career match records from Tennis Abstract, calculates age differences for players and opponents, and plots match outcomes as a scatterplot.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
